'''Team Liquid''' is a professional esports organization founded in the [[:category:Netherlands|Netherlands]] in 2000. Originally a ''[[starcraft:StarCraft|Brood War]]'' clan, the team switched to [[starcraft2:StarCraft|StarCraft II]] during the ''SC2 Beta'' in 2010, and became one of the most successful foreign teams. On August 7, 2020, Team Liquid entered ''VALORANT'' by signing [[fish123]].

